        "answer": {
          "short": "$x^2+7x+12$.\n\nCheck at $x=1$: both expressions equal $20$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(x+3)(x+4)&=x^2+4x+3x+12\\\\(x+3)(x+4)&=x^2+7x+12\\end{align*}$$\nCheck at $x=1$:\n$$\\begin{align*}(1+3)(1+4)&=20\\\\1^2+7(1)+12&=20\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 38
      },
      {
        "id": "p18-q1-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$(a+5)(a+8)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
