          "short": "$x^2+8x+15$.\n\nCheck at $x=1$: both expressions equal $24$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(3+x)(5+x)&=15+3x+5x+x^2\\\\(3+x)(5+x)&=x^2+8x+15\\end{align*}$$\nCheck at $x=1$:\n$$\\begin{align*}(3+1)(5+1)&=24\\\\1^2+8(1)+15&=24\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
